# Which /AOK/docs page becomes which GitHub wiki page.
#
# tools/sync-wiki.py publishes opt/AOK/docs/<source> to the ish-AOK wiki as
# <Page>.md, and rewrites the docs' relative links (roots.md and friends) into
# wiki page names using this table. A doc that is not listed here is NOT
# published -- which is how docs/book/ stays out, since it is a separate tree
# with its own manifest (fs/aok-book.manifest).
#
# Page names are deliberately spelled out rather than derived. The H1 of each
# doc is a sentence -- "ktop: an htop-style process viewer that understands
# multiple guest architectures" -- and no rule that produces a good page name
# from that also produces "/AOK" from "/AOK: what it is and how it's built".
#
# Format: <source file>  <Wiki-Page-Name>  <Title shown in the Home index>
#
# The title is here rather than derived from the page name because deriving it
# mangles the names that contain a real hyphen: "RISC-V-Vendor-Extensions"
# becomes "RISC V Vendor Extensions" and "proc-ish" becomes "proc ish". The
# one-line description beside each title is NOT here -- it is taken from the
# half of the doc's own H1 after the colon, so it cannot drift from the doc.
#
# Wiki page names use hyphens for spaces; that is GitHub's own convention and
# it is what the existing Crypto-Acceleration page already uses.

00-overview.md                 Overview                   Overview
benchmarks.md                  Benchmarks                 Benchmarks
binfmt-misc.md                 binfmt_misc                binfmt_misc
crypto-accel.md                Crypto-Acceleration        Crypto acceleration
file-browser.md                File-Browser               File browser
files-app-integration.md       Files-App-Integration      Files app integration
fuse.md                        FUSE                       FUSE
keyboard-shortcuts.md          Keyboard-Shortcuts         Keyboard shortcuts
keyboard-toolbar.md             Keyboard-Toolbar           Keyboard toolbar
ktop.md                        ktop                       ktop
llm-chat.md                    LLM-Chat                   LLM Chat
md.md                          md                         md
motepad.md                     motepad                    motepad
native-programs.md             Native-Programs            Native programs
native-setup.md                Native-Setup               Setting up native programs
networking.md                  Networking                 Networking
persist.md                     Persist                    /AOK/persist
proc-ish.md                    proc-ish                   /proc/ish
riscv64-vendor-extensions.md   RISC-V-Vendor-Extensions   RISC-V vendor extensions
roots.md                       Roots                      Filesystems, roots and chrooting
shortcuts.md                   Shortcuts                  Shortcuts
snippets.md                    Snippets                   Snippets
suspend.md                     Suspend-to-Disk            Suspend to disk
swap.md                        Swap                       Swap
themes.md                      Themes                     Themes
tuning-knobs.md                Tuning-Knobs               Runtime tuning
workspace.md                   Workspace                  Workspace
